msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"(That boxer Gatling Sendo should be around here\r\n"
"somewhere...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Hey, what the hell were you tryin' to pull?\r\n"
"You call that amazon you sent me to see a girl!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"But, Sendo-san, you saw her photo and picked her out\r\n"
"yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Yeah, some fine photo editing that was! The girl you showed\r\n"
"me in that photo was nothing like the atrocity I saw once I got there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Just who do you think you're messin' with, huh!? I'm the\r\n"
"prizefighter Gatling Sendo, and your face is gonna be my\r\n"
"next punchin' bag!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "(So that's Gatling Sendo, huh?)"
msgstr ""

